  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Hey everyone, my name''s Camilo Tomadin!

    You may know me better as
    <color=#00FFFF>"Olimac31"</color> due to my past work as a musician haha


    This
    is my first time making a proper game on Unity, made for my programming midterm.


    I
    was in charge of... basically everything LOL (coding, art, animation, SFX, music,
    made it all myself!)

    <color=grey>Just like the old days when I was making
    Biological Anomaly, eh?</color>


    Anyways, hope you enjoyed this small demo
    even if it was a short one :)



    Make sure to follow <color=green>@DecayingBits</color>
    on Twitter/X to see teasers from future updates!





    You can also follow
    <color=#00FFFF>@Olimac311</color> if you wanna see what else I''m up to!

    There''s
    also <color=#00FFFF>@Olimac31Art</color> if you wanna see more of my 2D art '
